BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CryoSPARC Interactive App Deployment - Michael Dickens [Texas A&M 
 University]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T171000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T172000
DTSTAMP:20261020T211454Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-KYBWAV@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:CryoSPARC is a leading cryo‑EM data‑processing platform. W
 hile CryoSPARC offers various installation methods\, each can pose signifi
 cant challenges for HPC users and system administrators ranging from versi
 on updates to port management.\n\nTo streamline deployment\, we have creat
 ed a CryoSPARC interactive app and a script for generating a Singularity i
 mage that eliminates the need for end‑users to perform any manual instal
 lation. This OOD app utilizes a CryoSPARC Singularity image that is shared
  among all users while providing each user with their own individual datab
 ase and log files. This dramatically reduces storage overhead and simplifi
 es version control\, while providing each researcher with a fully function
 al CryoSPARC environment.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/KYBWAV/
END:VEVENT
